     "titulo": "Fact, opinion and interpretation",
     "texto": [
      "A **fact** can be checked against a source; an **opinion** evaluates or recommends. An **interpretation** explains what a data point might mean, but it must be attributed and not presented as certain.",
      "Compare the figure with the assessment: **ankieta objęła 240 osób** is a data point; **nowe godziny są najlepsze** is an opinion."
